Dialog":4880101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[153501],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Qin1_488/Q48801","priority":5,"questId":488,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":4880101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1783471366,"text":"So this is where Charles' delivery got to.","nextNodeIds":[4880102]},{"nodeId":4880102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":3351701134,"text":"Have you come to rescue me? I've been waiting long enough.","nextNodeIds":[4880103]},{"nodeId":4880103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":3193972566,"text":"In all the time I've been working at the winery, this is the first time I've been robbed by hilichurls. *sigh*","nextNodeIds":[4880104]},{"nodeId":4880104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":3452153038,"text":"If you'd taken any longer, I don't know what I would have done.","nextNodeIds":[4880105]},{"nodeId":4880105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":425648702,"text":"#Fear not. {NICKNAME} here is a hilichurl exterminator extraordinaire!","nextNodeIds":[4880106]},{"nodeId":4880106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":1354328102,"text":"Just as well. Then... please escort this <color=#00E1FFFF>transporter</color> to the end of the road.","nextNodeIds":[4880107]},{"nodeId":4880107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":3319135094,"text":"And be careful with it. Just beating up the hilichurls is the not the aim here. You'd better <color=#00E1FFFF>make sure the goods stay intact</color> because I certainly don't have the Mora to replace them.","nextNodeIds":[4880108]},{"nodeId":4880108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":153501,"speakerName":"Ernest","textMapHash":3020272174,"text":"I'll be waiting up ahead."